<</Title(Identified limitations of standard RAG in retrieving chart/figure information and designed a synthetic benchmark to systematically evaluate multimodal retrieval approaches against published research claims. Implemented 6 retrieval/LLM pipelines spanning text-only, OCR-augmented, vision-grounded BM25/TF-IDF, and Qwen2-VL/Qwen2.5 and Gemini based chart captioning and answer generation.)/Dest[4 0 R/XYZ 25.52067 547.87808 0]/Count 0/Prev 33 0 R/Parent 32 0 R>>
