<</Title(Designed an automated RAG evaluation framework benchmarking retrieval, reranking, and generation configurations using Recall@K, MRR, nDCG, Context Precision/Recall, Faithfulness, and Answer Relevancy. Evaluated quality, grounding, latency, and token efficiency to isolate pipeline bottlenecks and identify the optimal accuracy-cost-latency trade-off across configurations.)/Dest[4 0 R/XYZ 25.52067 475.69056 0]/Count 0/Prev 36 0 R/Parent 35 0 R/Next 38 0 R>>
